sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Sender as Sending Node
    participant Socket as TCP Socket (Port 8888)
    participant Receiver as Receiving Node

    Sender->>Sender: Select File via SAF Picker
    Sender->>Receiver: Send FileMetadata (name, size, mimeType)
    Receiver-->>Sender: Metadata Accepted & Ready for Stream

    Sender->>Socket: Open BufferedOutputStream
    Socket->>Receiver: Stream Binary Chunks (64KB buffer)
    Note over Sender,Receiver: Real-time Transfer Progress Indicator

    Socket-->>Receiver: EOF / Transfer Complete
    Receiver->>Receiver: Verify File Integrity
    Receiver->>Receiver: Save via AndroidX FileProvider
    Receiver-->>Sender: Send FILE_TRANSFER_SUCCESS ACK